## 6. E-Contract Builder

### Admin Side — `/admin/contracts`
Rich text editor where admin builds contract templates:
- WYSIWYG editor (TipTap or similar)
- Template variables: `{{FULL_NAME}}`, `{{DATE}}`, `{{POSITION}}`, `{{START_DATE}}`
- Preview mode
- Save multiple templates

### Agent Side — `/dashboard/contract`
- Contract rendered with their details filled in
- Digital signature: type full name + "I agree" checkbox + date
- Download signed contract as PDF

### Database

```sql
CREATE TABLE public.contract_templates (
  id uuid default gen_random_uuid() primary key,
  title text not null,
  content text not null,          -- rich text / HTML
  created_by uuid references profiles(id),
  is_active boolean default true,
  created_at timestamptz default now(),
  updated_at timestamptz default now()
);

CREATE TABLE public.contracts (
  id uuid default gen_random_uuid() primary key,
  application_id uuid references applications(id),
  template_id uuid references contract_templates(id),
  rendered_content text,          -- template with variables filled in
  status text default 'pending' check (status in ('pending', 'sent', 'viewed', 'signed', 'expired')),
  signed_name text,
  signed_at timestamptz,
  contract_pdf_url text,
  created_at timestamptz default now()
);
```

